---
interface Props { questions: string[]; }
const { questions } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="open-questions" aria-labelledby="open-questions-title">
  <p class="kicker">what I'm still figuring out</p>
  <h2 id="open-questions-title">Open questions</h2>
  <p>I keep these visible on purpose. The roadmap is being built while I learn, and these are some of the places where my own understanding is still moving.</p>
  <ul>{questions.map((question) => <li>{question}</li>)}</ul>
</section>
